The party of heroes—Ekemon, Varkash, Dru, Oliver, and Farmer Tobin—embarked on a quest to rescue a displacer beast named Nightclaw, believed to be threatening the village of Blackpine. After a successful investigation and multiple battles against 25 goblins and 3 wolves, they freed Nightclaw and captured a goblin for information about a mysterious buyer known as the Bone-Merchant. Upon their return to Blackpine, the mayor expressed gratitude and offered a reward of 300 gold pieces, provisions, friendship, and salvage rights for resources at Moonfall Quarry. Each character received 1,000 experience points, propelling Ekemon and Varkash to level 6, while Tobin became an adventuring companion.
